The pattern reveals itself. A cart that holds, releases, counts, and clears. The SKU is the key—unique identifier, the thread that binds each item to its place. Adding twice to the same SKU? The quantities merge. Removing what isn't there? An error cries out. Setting quantity to zero or less? The item vanishes, as all things must.

No more, no less. The tests demanded this shape, and this shape I have given. To add beyond their asking would be hubris—the fatal flaw of those who cannot see where the story ends.

